  "details": "In a nutshell, display the Fallback avatar by default and only load your chosen avatar when you have approved someone to being able to view your avatar.\nAvatar theft/ripping is a common problem and the way it works is that someone running a third party program only needs to load in to a world and view your avatar to steal it. Having a buffer layer of being able to choose who loads your avatar will help mitigate (but not entirely prevent) this type of theft.",
